AArch64 RSW+obj-core+ldar
"Expected: Allowed. Source: Coq memory/ARMBar.v, ARMBar.RSWObjCore.rsw_obj_core_ldar_allowed. The Delta2 shape: order carried by an acquire on the last read only. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{
0:X1=z; 0:X4=x;
1:X1=z; 1:X4=x;
}
 P0           | P1          ;
 LDR W0,[X1]  | MOV W0,#1   ;
 MOV W9,#2    | STR W0,[X4] ;
 STR W9,[X1]  | DMB ST      ;
 LDAR W2,[X1] | STR W0,[X1] ;
 LDR W6,[X4]  |             ;
exists (0:X0=1 /\ 0:X2=2 /\ 0:X6=0)
